{"ratings":[{"id":"C1","consequence":"outage","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A restart between saving gate results and completing the stage can stop delivery of an unchanged, verified commit pending human intervention."},{"id":"C2","consequence":"bypass","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A pull-request lookup failure after HEAD changes allows the draft fallback to push before the claimed delivery guard runs, although it pushes the verified commit."},{"id":"C3","consequence":"bypass","trigger":"plausible","reason":"An amended merge with the expected parents passes the delivery guard and is published after gates without its added changes being audited or reviewed."}]}